      "name": "Paco"
    },
    "description": "Local, volatile course framework. UTF-8 JSON object bodies, 1 MiB maximum; text keys 1\u20131024 bytes. No authentication, CORS or external listener. See docs/api.md for concurrency and retry semantics."
  },
